codex
The failure is now isolated: this container exposes host PIDs in `/proc` while `getpid()` returns the nested PID, and Lean 4.22 constructs `/proc/<getpid>/exe`; its lookup therefore misses. I’m applying a narrow process-local compatibility shim only to the `lake` subprocess so Lean receives the `/proc`-visible PID. The generated project and all mounted evidence remain untouched.
apply patch
